OL,5,G1900 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,6,     FBen ventures into a forested
OL,7,     Fwilderness to stay with two
OL,8,     Fremarkable artists, throwing
OL,9,     Fhimself into a world of art and
OL,10,     Fnature, and tackling tasks the
OL,11,     Fpair struggle with.
OL,12,G2000 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,13,     FBen visits a remarkable habitation
OL,14,     Fperched on one of the region's
OL,15,     Fhighest mountains - home to the
OL,16,     FBellrose family - where daily life
OL,17,     Fcan be a matter of survival.
